Description: Only the library is configured and built
 The packages ship only libgmp, gmp.h and gmp.pc. Without tests, cxx,
 demos, tune and doc in AC_OUTPUT and SUBDIRS, automake and configure
 do not read their makefiles, the demos' config headers or gmpxx.pc.in.
 Without the demos, configure needs no yacc or lex. In foreign mode
 automake needs no AUTHORS, ChangeLog, NEWS or README.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-04
---
--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
 ## Process this file with automake to generate Makefile.in
+# Modified 2026-11-04: only the library is built (GPL-2.0 section 2(a), GPL-3.0 section 5(a)).
+# Modified 2026-11-04: automake runs in foreign mode (GPL-2.0 section 2(a), GPL-3.0 section 5(a)).
 
 
 # Copyright 1991, 1993, 1994, 1996, 1997, 1999-2004, 2006-2009, 2011-2016,
@@ -36,7 +38,7 @@
 # Makefiles in subdirectories, but here we must omit it so automake gives
 # the actual ansi2knr build rule, not "cd $(top_builddir) && make ansi2knr".
 #
-# AUTOMAKE_OPTIONS = 1.8 gnu no-dependencies
+# AUTOMAKE_OPTIONS = 1.8 foreign no-dependencies
 
 
 # Libtool -version-info for libgmp.la and libmp.la.  See "Versioning" in the
